            "The first intake should collect account name, renewal date, product usage fields, open support items, and owner notes. Those fields are not a substitute for professional judgment; they are the minimum context needed to prevent a reviewer from searching through scattered messages. Mark unknown information as missing rather than filling it from guesswork. A visible gap is safer than a confident but unsupported value."
