            "Access should follow the work unit. Give the assistant the queue, source material, and named account needed to prepare a factual brief with unresolved questions and a named account owner; keep commercial negotiation, product commitments, pricing, and churn decisions with the accountable owner. Prefer individual accounts, limited permissions, and a clear way to revoke access. The owner should also decide how sensitive records are redacted before examples are shared."
